OL,3,GNEWSAChildren's home planned amid
OL,4,A'crisis' in care
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe application, developed with
OL,7,FChildren, Young People, Education and
OL,8,FSkills, seeks permission to change the
OL,9,Fuse of the property from a private
OL,10,Fdwelling to a registered home for up to
OL,11,Ffour children aged 10 to 18.
OL,13,FThe property was purchased by the
OL,14,Fgovernment as part of its Overdale
OL,15,FHospital redevelopment project but
OL,16,Fafter planning revisions the site was
OL,17,Fscaled down.
OL,23,APub: 12-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
